jp-edinet
=========

This plugin uses the EDINET API (Electronic Disclosure for Investors' NETwork)
operated by the Financial Services Agency of Japan. EDINET data use is subject to
EDINET terms (WZEK0030) and the Public Data License (PDL1.0).

- EDINET / 金融庁: https://disclosure2.edinet-fsa.go.jp/
- WZEK0030: https://disclosure2dl.edinet-fsa.go.jp/guide/static/disclosure/WZEK0030.html
- PDL1.0: https://www.digital.go.jp/resources/open_data/public_data_license_v1.0

Plugin code in this repository is MIT (see LICENSE). Offline fixtures under
tests/fixtures/ are derived from public EDINET API responses.

Headline metrics map EDINET taxonomy element IDs. This repository does not
redistribute taxonomy files. The Financial Services Agency requires this
attribution when quoting the taxonomy, together with the intellectual-property
statement:

© Copyright 2014 Financial Services Agency, The Japanese Government

https://www.fsa.go.jp/search/EDINET_Taxonomy_Legal_Statement.html
